      "svg": "<svg viewBox='0 0 1100 1100' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><rect x='0' y='0' width='1100' height='1100' fill='#1a1a2e'/><text x='550' y='70' font-size='30' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>Staged Viability Testing</text><rect x='100' y='160' width='220' height='260' rx='14' fill='#1a1a2e' stroke='#0ea5e9' stroke-width='4'/><text x='210' y='210' font-size='18' fill='#0ea5e9' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>Stage 1</text><text x='210' y='250' font-size='15' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>Side classes</text><text x='210' y='275' font-size='15' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>while employed</text><rect x='150' y='320' width='120' height='70' fill='#0ea5e9' opacity='0.3'/><text x='210' y='363' font-size='15' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>few payers</text><rect x='360' y='160' width='220' height='260' rx='14' fill='#1a1a2e' stroke='#8b5cf6' stroke-width='4'/><text x='470' y='210' font-size='18' fill='#8b5cf6' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>Stage 2</text><text x='470' y='250' font-size='15' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>Growing paid</text><text x='470' y='275' font-size='15' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>enrollment</text><rect x='400' y='290' width='140' height='100' fill='#8b5cf6' opacity='0.3'/><text x='470' y='353' font-size='15' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>more payers</text><rect x='620' y='160' width='220' height='260' rx='14' fill='#1a1a2e' stroke='#f59e0b' stroke-width='4'/><text x='730' y='210' font-size='18' fill='#f59e0b' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>Stage 3</text><text x='730' y='250' font-size='15' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>Rent shared</text><text x='730' y='275' font-size='15' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>studio space</text><rect x='650' y='260' width='160' height='130' fill='#f59e0b' opacity='0.3'/><text x='730' y='343' font-size='15' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>steady demand</text><rect x='880' y='160' width='150' height='260' rx='14' fill='#1a1a2e' stroke='#10b981' stroke-width='4'/><text x='955' y='210' font-size='18' fill='#10b981' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>Stage 4</text><text x='955' y='250' font-size='15' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>Own</text><text x='955' y='275' font-size='15' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle'>studio</text><rect x='900' y='230' width='110' height='160' fill='#10b981' opacity='0.3'/><text x='550' y='500' font-size='20' fill='#ffd700' text-anchor='middle'>Each stage gated by evidence, not enthusiasm</text><text x='550' y='620' font-size='18' fill='#888' text-anchor='middle'>Contrast: full commitment before a single sale — a common failure pattern</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Financial viability is tracked continuously and gates each new level of commitment."
